{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o055b","title":"遣后宫淑媛昭仪以下归家","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o055b-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"遣后宫淑媛昭仪以下归家","evidence":["wendi-e-o055b-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":226,"label":"黄初七年五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y226","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o054","basis":"黄初七年五月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o055b-q","wendi-q-o054","wendi-q-o049","wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o055b-q","source_order":[2,489,"O055b"],"order":677}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o055b-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-de99b91993873e12670a","layer":"original","quote":"遣后宫淑媛、昭仪以下归其家。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":488,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：黄初六年（公元 225）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":467,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-61512c4ade75d71d6a76","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o049","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-d5847039c2d504d36e8e","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，遣使者循行许昌以东，尽沛郡〖2〗。问民所疾苦，贫者赈贷之。﹝一﹞三月，行幸召陵〖3〗，通讨虏渠〖4〗。乙巳〖5〗，还许昌宫。并州刺史梁习讨鲜卑轲比能〖6〗，大破之。辛未〖7〗，帝为舟师，东征。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o054","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-19250f15bc304637f90e","layer":"original","quote":"七年春正月，将幸许昌。许昌城南门，无故自崩；帝心恶之，遂不入。壬子〖1〗，行还洛阳宫。三月，筑九华台〖2〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":487,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
